# Generated data sidecars are written with LF by their generators (scripts/gen-*.mjs) and their
# freshness is verified by a byte-for-byte `--check` in `npm run sync`. Pin them to LF so an
# autocrlf checkout on Windows can't rewrite them to CRLF and make that check false-positive.
src/data/conditionalKeywords.json text eol=lf
src/data/sourceIds.json text eol=lf
